<section id="ai">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head reveal">
      <h2 class="sec-title">On <span class="bx bx-flip">AI</span></h2>
    </header>
    <div class="pov-grid">
      <blockquote class="pov-quote reveal">
        AI is a tool. Put it in the right hands, with the right intent, <em>and it does great work.</em>
      </blockquote>
      <ol class="principles">
        <li class="principle reveal"><div><h3>I work at the product level</h3><p>With AI, I'm the product manager. I set the direction for design, technical approach and user experience, and an agent team builds it. That's where I've been most effective, and where I want to work. I built Promus this way.</p></div></li>
        <li class="principle reveal"><div><h3>A tool, not a savior or a doomsday machine</h3><p>AI won't save us, and it won't doom us, any more than any technology before it did. The results depend on who's using it and what they want from it.</p></div></li>
        <li class="principle reveal"><div><h3>Creative work starts with a person</h3><p>AI shouldn't replace creative people. I see unexplored room for it inside the creative process, but music, film and writing should come from a human mind. AI might be on the keyboard sometimes. A person sets the direction and the standard of excellence. I don't use AI in my own music right now.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
